  ("In short","<ul><li>No analytics, no advertising, no tracking cookies or pixels.</li><li>We do not sell or share your data for marketing.</li><li>Our website, contact form and email sending run on Microsoft Azure in the European Union (North Europe, Ireland).</li><li>The site is delivered through Cloudflare&rsquo;s network, which is explained below.</li><li>You can ask us at any time to access or delete your data.</li></ul>"),
